                          Priority Queue Implement By Heap

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Operation	                    Responsibility                                  Status
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Insert	                        Add a key-value pair
Peek	                        Examine the highest-priority entry
Remove	                        Remove the highest-priority entry
Heapify Up	                    Restore order after insertion
Heapify Down	                Restore order after removal
IsEmpty	                        Check whether the structure is empty
Size	                        Return the number of entries







